### Get home page
GET http://localhost:8080/ HTTP/1.1




### Get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/books HTTP/1.1

### Get all customers
GET http://localhost:8080/customers HTTP/1.1





### Get existing book
GET http://localhost:8080/books/68ce23b2fb19f10ed2099214 HTTP/1.1

### Get existing customer
GET http://localhost:8080/customers/68ce246cfb19f10ed2099215 HTTP/1.1

### Get existing book
GET http://localhost:8080/books/68ce261dfb19f10ed209921c HTTP/1.1

### Get existing customer
GET http://localhost:8080/customers/68ce24edfb19f10ed2099218 HTTP/1.1






### Create book
POST http://localhost:8080/books HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

    {
        "tittle": "Discover Peru",
        "author": "Alan Carlos",
        "genre": "tourism",
        "number_of_pages": "215",
        "publication_date": "11/05/2020",
        "category": "guide"
    }

### Update book
PUT http://localhost:8080/books/68ceb6b041c66a96bd2d3727
Content-Type: application/json  

{
    "tittle": "Discover Lima",
    "author": "Alan Carlos",
    "genre": "tourism",
    "number_of_pages": "215",
    "publication_date": "11/05/2020",
    "category": "guide"
}

### Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/books/68d35f410ac6c81aa64d9566 HTTP/1.1






### Create customer
POST http://localhost:8080/customers HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "johndoe@sample.com"
}

### Update book
PUT http://localhost:8080/customers/68ceb73eed30a0ff90b46050 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json  

{
    "firstName": "Jane",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "janedoe@sample.com"
}

### Delete book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/customers/68ceb73eed30a0ff90b46050 HTTP/1.1    



